{"id":"vod_sn_35535","vodId":"35535","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"魔法少女魔法破坏者","name_cn":"魔法少女魔法破坏者","date":"2023-01-01","year":"2023","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"全12集","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/697ed518638a4ece2fa448d8921f5890.jpg"},"summary":"2008年——神秘势力的出现，动漫、游戏、漫画、音乐、铁路、cosplay等所有御宅文化都被排除的日本。周边被收容，宅男被以保护的名义镇压，人们仿佛失去了自我，毫无疑问。被负责维持秩序的组织“SSC”蹂躏，宅男以为已经灭亡了——但是，夺回被封锁的秋叶原后，出现了揭竿而起的人。年轻的革命者“御宅英雄”——比什么都热爱御宅文化，比谁都热爱秋叶的男人。还有仰慕他的3个魔法少女——“无政府”、“蓝”、“粉”。以2011年的日本为舞台，聚集在自由之旗下的宅男们——秋叶革命军，挑战SSC首领“SHOBON”的壮烈的战斗。为了这个可以破坏混沌和秩序，尽情地喜欢自己喜欢的东西的世界。聚集在自由旗帜下的宅男们啊。夺回被剥夺的文化掀起OTAKU COUNTER CULTURE !","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:35:32","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/Lm832jwUrY1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/4k4dMLjefn1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/bXj3dTNvjP1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/wH3J3p7KiW1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/32jwEJfHBb1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/h2k7u8vWPb1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/ADNiExbZsd1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/jvU6rpsi5e1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/V4r84qqfNV1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/MEDQ8mFhnB1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/ervL1Wu0Mf1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/j3BGAuMTd21/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:33.918Z"}